    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated in the highly sought-after Summercove area on the edge of Kinsale town, this attractive three-bedroom semi-detached bungalow enjoys an elevated position, in a small cul de sac with excellent views extending over Kinsale Outer Harbour, The Dock Beach and Castlepark.\n\nExtending to approximately 109 sq m, the property offers well-proportioned accommodation all on one level and presents an excellent opportunity for those seeking a home in this popular coastal location, with easy access to the R600 to Cork City and airport.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming living room with open fire to the front of the property, enjoying wonderful west-facing water views, along with a generous kitchen/diner. Both rooms benefit from patio doors opening directly onto the front patio and garden, creating a lovely connection between the indoor and outdoor living spaces and making the most of the property`s exceptional outlook.\n\nThere are three bedrooms, including a spacious master bedroom with ensuite, together with a main family bathroom.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from off-street parking for two cars, an attached garage and an enclosed rear patio garden. The front garden and patio provide an ideal spot to sit and enjoy the afternoon and evening sun while taking in the impressive water views.\n\nThe property is heated by oil-fired central heating and has a BER rating of C3.\n\nThe property has been freshly decorated and comes to market ready for occupation, its superb location, generous accommodation and exceptional water views offer considerable appeal. Summercove and the renowned Bulman Restaurant are within a short stroll. Kinsale`s vibrant heart sits within easy walking distance, putting you right beside a rich mix of independent boutiques, coffee shops, and renowned dining.\n\nAn ideal opportunity for those seeking to downsize their home or coastal retreat in one of Kinsale`s most desirable locations.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
